316
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,360
Enjoy washing the dishes.

317
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:27,800
Thanks.

318
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:28,640
It looks so good.

319
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:30,320
