323
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,480
Back to reality.

324
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,080
Yeah, back to reality.

325
00:10:41,680 --> 00:10:43,520
Back to washing dishes.

326
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,480
Back to reality.

327
00:10:57,540 --> 00:10:59,580
