357
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:03,160
Do you guys want to take a photo?

358
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:04,000
Sure.

359
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,040
Liaing Xiaoyu, do you want a photo?

360
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:05,800
Sure, no problem.

361
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,880
This spot looks so good.

362
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,960
Seriously, this spot is beautiful.

363
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,960
Why don't you move a little closer

364
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:12,080
