366
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,800
Three, two, one.

367
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:18,040
Let's take a look.

368
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:21,120
That circle.

369
00:12:21,120 --> 00:12:21,520
Nice.

370
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:22,240
The composition is great.

371
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:23,320
Nice.

372
00:12:23,320 --> 00:12:24,920
This really looks good.

373
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:26,520
I want one here too.

374
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:27,000
Come on.

375
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:27,600
I'll take one for you.

376
00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:27,840
Come on.

377
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:29,280
I think this spot looks really good.

378
00:12:29,340 --> 00:12:30,940
(Glances)

379
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:37,720
That's hilarious.

380
00:12:39,040 --> 00:12:40,640
Let me take one of you two first.

381
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:42,920
Sure.

382
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,300
Move a little closer.

383
00:12:46,300 --> 00:12:46,780
