386
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:51,840
Xilun, smile.

387
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:52,680
One,

388
00:12:52,680 --> 00:12:53,600
two.

389
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,320
No fake smiles.

390
00:12:57,700 --> 00:12:58,160
Handsome guy and beautiful girl.

391
00:12:58,160 --> 00:12:59,160
Hope it looks good.

392
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:00,840
It's good.

393
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:01,560
This one really looks good.

394
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:02,560
Looks good.

395
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:03,440
Even your smile looks good.

396
00:13:04,580 --> 00:13:05,200
(Take a look)

397
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:06,600
You look so natural in this one.

398
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:09,800
This one looks great.

399
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:12,340
(Smiles)

400
00:13:18,600 --> 00:13:19,240
Turn around.

401
00:13:19,560 --> 00:13:20,320
Okay, turn around.

402
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,120
Turn around.

403
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:29,920
