404
00:13:31,680 --> 00:13:32,480
Let it drift for a bit.

405
00:13:34,880 --> 00:13:35,920
Look at that water droplet.

406
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:38,480
That's amazing.

407
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:40,840
Can you make anything

408
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,360
