409
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:43,740
Lotus leaf-wrapped chicken.

410
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:46,200
It's really good.

411
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:46,960
Okay.

412
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,800
