438
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:39,280
He eats pretty well then.

439
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:39,900
Egg yolks.

440
00:14:39,900 --> 00:14:40,240
Yeah.

441
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,320
Sometimes I also give him

442
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:42,680
