443
00:14:42,680 --> 00:14:44,920
He eats really well.

444
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:45,760
Happy little dog.

445
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,160
That's a huge mosquito bite.

446
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,020
