Stop the itching.

450
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:55,640
It should help with the itching, right?

451
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:56,520
Thanks.

452
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:56,840
Okay.

453
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:58,960
I think your arm

454
00:14:58,960 --> 00:15:00,000
