455
00:15:01,440 --> 00:15:02,560
Make it more concentrated.

456
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:03,600
Thanks.

457
00:15:09,560 --> 00:15:10,840
So when you all

458
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,760
