467
00:15:25,880 --> 00:15:27,080
(Happy)

468
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:29,360
I played The Little Mermaid recently.

469
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:31,240
That suits you.

470
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,600
Wasn't that basically playing yourself?

471
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:35,040
What do you mean?

472
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:38,160
The Little Mermaid.

473
00:15:38,960 --> 00:15:40,800
I just feel like you're perfect
for the role.

474
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:43,080
Thanks.

475
00:15:54,120 --> 00:15:55,000
If I get the chance,

476
00:15:56,280 --> 00:15:57,160
I'll go see it.

477
00:15:57,160 --> 00:15:58,120
Okay.

478
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,720
I really want
to watch you guys rehearse.

479
00:16:00,880 --> 00:16:01,600
Okay.

480
00:16:08,160 --> 00:16:09,600
Stargazing room.

481
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:12,280
If we row around here
and look at the stars...

482
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,320
There are stars.

483
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:13,680
Look.

484
00:16:13,680 --> 00:16:14,600
There are stars.

485
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:16,160
You can point at the stars, right?

486
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:16,840
Yeah, you can.

487
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,840
Do you think they are still there?

488
00:16:20,840 --> 00:16:21,640
They should be.

489
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:23,040
They can't have eaten that fast, right?

490
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:24,680
Who goes there just to eat?

491
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:26,160
Go there just to eat.

492
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:27,080
Yeah.

493
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:34,000
Liang Renfang and Yu Yang.

494
00:16:35,800 --> 00:16:37,040
Who's that?

495
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:39,040
Hi.

496
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:41,460
So romantic.

497
00:16:41,460 --> 00:16:42,120
You know, we were just talking

498
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:42,880
