501
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,760
Then we turned around and saw you two.

502
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:48,720
We're just floating around here.

503
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:49,960
We're the Courageous.

504
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:50,640
Yeah, you are.

505
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:51,440
You're extremely brave.

506
00:16:52,080 --> 00:16:53,120
The moon is really full tonight.

507
00:16:53,120 --> 00:16:54,280
You can take a look.

508
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:55,960
Really?

509
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:57,280
Where?

510
00:16:58,800 --> 00:16:59,520
You two enjoy.

511
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:00,520
We'll leave you two alone for now.

512
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:01,920
