513
00:17:01,920 --> 00:17:02,680
Okay.

514
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,480
There are stars.

515
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:07,280
Get it adjusted so you can see them.

516
00:17:22,900 --> 00:17:25,380
(Everyone gradually heads out)

517
00:17:34,780 --> 00:17:35,980
