528
00:18:00,440 --> 00:18:01,200
No.

529
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:03,040
Okay, I'll make you something.

530
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:09,400
Okay, thanks.

531
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,960
No problem. Just wait over there.

532
00:18:11,960 --> 00:18:12,640
Okay.

533
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,960
What made you decide

534
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,520
