537
00:18:30,600 --> 00:18:31,480
It's okay. No rush.

538
00:18:33,340 --> 00:18:34,500
(Sneaks a glance)

539
00:18:41,700 --> 00:18:43,140
(Glances)

540
00:18:45,140 --> 00:18:47,180
(Another glance)

541
00:18:52,040 --> 00:18:54,620
(Asking)
What can I do?

542
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:55,560
What can I do?

543
00:18:55,560 --> 00:18:56,540
Wash these.

544
00:18:56,540 --> 00:18:57,200
(Hands over blueberries)
Okay.

545
00:18:57,200 --> 00:18:58,480
We can eat them later.

546
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,200
Have you had this before?

547
00:19:15,220 --> 00:19:16,180
(Chili powder)

548
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:18,240
Here.

549
00:19:18,260 --> 00:19:19,340
(Freshly washed blueberries)

550
00:19:21,840 --> 00:19:22,600
Thanks.

551
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:26,160
Chili flakes.

552
00:19:26,160 --> 00:19:27,440
You eat chili flakes for breakfast?

553
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:28,480
No.

554
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:29,640
You can have them with bread.

555
00:19:29,640 --> 00:19:31,000
I didn't know if you'd eat this.

556
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:34,360
You can add some.

557
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:35,200
You...

558
00:19:36,400 --> 00:19:38,040
You don't like this?

559
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:38,840
You don't like it?

560
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:41,760
I've never had it.

561
00:19:42,320 --> 00:19:43,560
You can try it in a bit.

562
00:19:48,920 --> 00:19:49,800
I'll put some on the side.

563
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:51,080
You can try it later.

564
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:52,720
Let's give it a taste.

565
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:56,560
I'll put it here.

566
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,440
Okay, thanks.

567
00:20:04,880 --> 00:20:06,120
You can try it first.

568
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,240
Try this.

569
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:10,200
(Repeats)
See if you like the flavor.

570
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:11,680
What?

571
00:20:13,760 --> 00:20:14,840
I said, try this.

572
00:20:14,840 --> 00:20:15,600
See if you like it.

573
00:20:15,960 --> 00:20:17,720
Okay, sure.

574
00:20:19,480 --> 00:20:20,640
I dip it in, right?

575
00:20:20,640 --> 00:20:21,440
Okay.

576
00:20:29,320 --> 00:20:30,120
Is it good?

577
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:32,880
So that's what it tastes like.

578
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:35,880
That's so interesting.

579
00:20:41,280 --> 00:20:42,120
There's eggs here.

580
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:42,960
You should have some eggs too.

581
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:45,040
(Again)
Have some eggs.

582
00:20:45,040 --> 00:20:46,040
Okay, sure.

583
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:54,340
(Both laugh)

584
00:21:02,800 --> 00:21:03,560
I feel like neither of us

585
00:21:03,560 --> 00:21:05,480
